1
00:00:00,578 --> 00:00:04,078
Do I say "Stop what?"
or just throw in the towel?

2
00:00:04,082 --> 00:00:06,302
(Beverley:)I don't see why I should
have to watch your father

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,500
(Beverley:)parade around with some
Bible-thumping bumpkin.

4
00:00:09,504 --> 00:00:11,884
(Sheldon:)Oh, excuse me, that is my mother
you're talking about,

5
00:00:11,889 --> 00:00:14,089
(Sheldon:)however accurately.

6
00:00:14,092 --> 00:00:15,592
Okay, Beverly,

7
00:00:15,593 --> 00:00:16,763
(Penny:)aren't you overreacting
a little?

8
00:00:16,761 --> 00:00:18,931
(Penny:)All we know is they shared
a cab and had a nightcap.

9
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,150
(Sheldon:)And turned their phones off.

10
00:00:20,148 --> 00:00:23,428
(Leonard:)Not helping, buddy.

11
00:00:23,434 --> 00:00:25,904
(Leonard:)Mother, Penny and I really want
you to be part of this.

12
00:00:25,903 --> 00:00:27,023
(Leonard:)Please stay.

13
00:00:27,021 --> 00:00:27,991
(Penny:)Yeah, plus if you leave,

14
00:00:27,989 --> 00:00:29,939
(Penny:)Alfred will know
he got under your skin.

15
00:00:33,411 --> 00:00:35,441
(Beverley:)Well, we can't have that.

16
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:38,331
(Sheldon:)You know, also,
if they did have coitus,

17
00:00:38,332 --> 00:00:40,532
(Sheldon:)we'll all be needing
a skilled psychiatrist.

18
00:00:43,838 --> 00:00:46,288
(Raj:)It is funny
when you think about it.

19
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:47,340
(Howard:)Maybe to you.

20
00:00:47,341 --> 00:00:49,511
(Howard:)You didn't get
a $500 traffic ticket.

21
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:52,850
(Bernadette:)Because you were driving
like a lunatic.

22
00:00:52,847 --> 00:00:54,627
(Howard:)Hey, if thinking
secret government agents

23
00:00:54,632 --> 00:01:00,022
(Howard:)are chasing you makes you
a lunatic, then... yeah, okay.

